  _subtitlesData:
  - _text: You are officially an astronaut
    _timeStamp: 46.667
  - _text: This whole journey is not just about going to space
    _timeStamp: 48.4
  - _text: "It\u2019s the training, it\u2019s the team"
    _timeStamp: 53.667
  - _text: I feel super connected to love
    _timeStamp: 57.2
  - _text: So connected to love
    _timeStamp: 60.267
  - _text: I think has shown me
    _timeStamp: 61.967
  - _text: You never know how much love is inside of you
    _timeStamp: 64.967
  - _text: Like how much love you have to give
    _timeStamp: 68.033
  - _text: And how loved you are
    _timeStamp: 71.333
  - _text: Until the day you launch
    _timeStamp: 73.933
  - _text: 'This is experience is right '
    _timeStamp: 75.867
  - _text: Is second to being a mom
    _timeStamp: 78.867
